Cell["Internal vector bundle and bases", "Section",
 CellID->1516,ExpressionUUID->"074b0ad6-a25c-4c01-9b7e-5099c6dd37ff"],

Cell["\<\
The theory we have in mind in this Tech Note is the 5d gauged STU model. \
Thus, we must also include a VectorBundle for the internal indices:\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->1517,ExpressionUUID->"d8131be6-9573-4412-a337-ca6a63c87f08"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"IncludeTo", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sol", "[", "$bundle", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Symbol", " ", "->", " ", "Internal\[ScriptCapitalM]"}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"Manifold", " ", "->", " ", "\[ScriptCapitalM]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Dimension", " ", "->", " ", "3"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Index", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "\[GothicCapitalA]", ",", " ", "\[GothicCapitalB]", ",", " ", 
        "\[GothicCapitalC]", ",", " ", "\[GothicCapitalD]", ",", " ", 
        "\[GothicCapitalE]", ",", " ", "\[GothicCapitalF]", ",", " ", 
        "\[GothicCapitalG]", ",", " ", "\[GothicCapitalH]", ",", " ", 
        "\[GothicCapitalI]", ",", " ", "\[GothicCapitalJ]", ",", " ", 
        "\[GothicCapitalK]", ",", " ", "\[GothicCapitalL]"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "PrintAs", " ", "->", " ", 
      "\"\<\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]\[ScriptCapitalM]\>\""}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Metric", " ", "->", " ", "None"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"InvariantTraceTensor", " ", "->", " ", "None"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[27]:=",
 CellID->1518,ExpressionUUID->"b929baa3-0ba1-4a9a-9c30-19afeaf37899"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "At this point, say, the \[Gamma]-matrices are abstract tensorial objects, \
as we have not yet defined any bases for the vector bundles present: Tangent\
\[ScriptCapitalM], Frame\[ScriptCapitalM], Spin\[ScriptCapitalM], Internal\
\[ScriptCapitalM]. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ToBases"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/ToBases", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "79b3369c-4fe8-49e0-93bb-7cd95a3a93d8"],
 " is SolutionsX\[CloseCurlyQuote]s wrapper over xAct\[CloseCurlyQuote]s ",
 ButtonBox["ToBasis",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  Appearance->None,
  Evaluator->Automatic,
  ButtonFunction:>NotebookOpen[
    FindFile["xAct/Documentation/English/" <> "xCobaDoc.nb"]]],
 " that automatically selects the appropriate bases for each of the abstract \
indices. Below it does nothing:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1519,ExpressionUUID->"d5467bee-5453-4ffe-9ec7-20b31107919a"],

