Cell["Tensors", "Section",
 CellID->1551,ExpressionUUID->"304d7844-a7a6-49aa-b2b8-6a49c7e4a3f4"],

Cell["\<\
Next we include the following tensors: QQ for the metric on the internal \
space, XX for the scalars on the internal space, CC for the totally symmetric \
tensor on the internal space, VV for the Fayet\[Dash]Iliopoulos parameters, \
\[ScriptCapitalV]\[ScriptCapitalV] for the scalar potential. The remaining \
ones will get explained in a moment. Note that in SolutionsX it is perfectly \
allowed for a tensor to carry no indices. We also include two constant \
symbols to represent the Newton constant and the AdS scale.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1552,ExpressionUUID->"5be23a4b-8792-41f6-a22b-e460bafd3987"],

