Cell["\<\
We have to teach xAct how these tensors are related to each other. We have \
intentionally not specified a metric on Internal\[ScriptCapitalM], so we have \
to supply the tensor rules one by one. Take for example XX:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1555,ExpressionUUID->"907363f9-0cff-4bbd-a5bc-dde828f07420"],

