Cell["Killing spinor equations", "Section",
 CellID->1730,ExpressionUUID->"227edc79-3581-4c30-a3b3-801a72c80434"],

Cell["\<\
To proceed we need to include a spinor. The syntax is similar to before. \
Since we are in 5d the spinor must be of Dirac type.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1731,ExpressionUUID->"b2ade021-6d0c-46ad-b481-de13b46b6413"],

